(7662836, 1249199, 173844, '<td valign="top">Joyous child in a wide open, sunshiny world.  Nothing better.  She''s so well placed.  The flat terrain, including the water, is interesting and beckoning.  The towers and lines seem musical and pull our eye into the distance, like an echo.  Though weighted to the right, the image doesn''t at all feel unbalanced.<br/>Personal favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Joyous child in a wide open, sunshiny world.  Nothing better.  She''s so well placed.  The flat terrain, including the water, is interesting and beckoning.  The towers and lines seem musical and pull our eye into the distance, like an echo.  Though weighted to the right, the image doesn''t at all feel unbalanced.Personal favorite of the challenge.', '2020-05-17 16:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7662837, 1249157, 173844, '<td valign="top">A jewel, and still sapphires and diamonds are dear.  Fascinating, compelling, admirable.  The focus fade on the wings is also lovely, as if a quilt has been settled on the fly''s back.  Nice light.</td>', 'A jewel, and still sapphires and diamonds are dear.  Fascinating, compelling, admirable.  The focus fade on the wings is also lovely, as if a quilt has been settled on the fly''s back.  Nice light.', '2020-05-17 16:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7662852, 1249092, 173844, '<td valign="top">Refreshing and tactile.  Lovely, subtle diagonal in the clothesline.  Nice contrast between the laundry and the filigree of shadows and trees.  The hammock looks, to me, a bit out of place.  Overall, though, very appealing.</td>', 'Refreshing and tactile.  Lovely, subtle diagonal in the clothesline.  Nice contrast between the laundry and the filigree of shadows and trees.  The hammock looks, to me, a bit out of place.  Overall, though, very appealing.', '2020-05-17 22:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7662853, 1249246, 173844, '<td valign="top">So forthright you can hear the bird''s call.  I love that tangle of branches he or she is amidst.  The thrusting foreground forces you into the image.  Altogether engaging.</td>', 'So forthright you can hear the bird''s call.  I love that tangle of branches he or she is amidst.  The thrusting foreground forces you into the image.  Altogether engaging.', '2020-05-17 22:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(7662855, 1248794, 173844, '<td valign="top">Subtle.  The softish focus endows the portrait with intimacy, as does her wistful gaze.  Is there urgency here?  So hard to read.  The indistinct shading on the right brings it all into balance.  Fine image.</td>', 'Subtle.  The softish focus endows the portrait with intimacy, as does her wistful gaze.  Is there urgency here?  So hard to read.  The indistinct shading on the right brings it all into balance.  Fine image.', '2020-05-17 22:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7662856, 1249201, 173844, '<td valign="top">Offhand moment, fine composition.  The toning imbues the image with warmth.  Dog''s-eye perspective pull''s you into her or his world.  Works well.</td>', 'Offhand moment, fine composition.  The toning imbues the image with warmth.  Dog''s-eye perspective pull''s you into her or his world.  Works well.', '2020-05-17 22:49:57.000000', NULL, 1),
